      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CORLESS THE KING (2) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has hit the frame at his last four runs, the latest finishing third (18.76) at this track. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Likely to be in the finish again. HARDY (8) is progressing well claiming his 2nd career win latest, scoring by a neck (18.52) at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Sure to be thereabouts. CANYA BONFIRE (6) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 320m behind Despicable Milo (18.89) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Key runner on best form. SHE'S OUTLANDISH (4) is a chance after five months.",
